# Template — see tofu/tailscale/secrets.sops.env.example for the procedure.
# BUNNYNET_API_KEY comes from Bitwarden via `bws run`, not from here.
#
# Node addresses are deliberately absent: they are declared in this module's node-refs.env and
# read from ansible/nodes/<node>/host.sops.yml at plan/apply time. A second encrypted copy here
# would drift silently against the first.
#
# TF_VAR_tailnet_domain is the target of the internal wildcard CNAME in dns.tf. It duplicates
# tofu/tailscale's TAILSCALE_TAILNET — unavoidably, since node-refs.env resolves node addresses
# only. Change both together.
TF_VAR_tailnet_domain=example-tailnet.ts.net
